// Game: Postretro
// Format: Standard
// E18 seeded trap-pool fixture.
// Compile: cargo run -p postretro-level-compiler -- content/dev/maps/trap-pools.map -o content/dev/maps/trap-pools.prl
// Run the catalog-scoped mod-global pool: cargo run -p xtask -- run, then choose
// Trap Pools from the dev-level menu. A direct .prl launch exercises only the
// level-local pool because raw paths intentionally carry no catalog tags.
// The upper row is the level-local closet_trap pool. The lower row is the
// mod-global ambush_trap pool, selected only when this map's catalog tag matches.
